WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.418
Frederick Krueger, later known as Fred, or most commonly Freddy, was born

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:06.442
in the early 1940s as the son of a nun named Amanda Krueger.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:09.818
She was part of a religious order that ran an asylum known as Westin Hills

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.534
and did volunteer work there from time to time.

00:00:11.572 --> 00:00:14.238
When Amanda was young, she was accidentally locked in award for the

00:00:14.244 --> 00:00:17.214
criminally insane over the holidays and the inmates kept her hidden for days.

00:00:17.252 --> 00:00:20.878
When she was found, she was barely alive and is now pregnant with a child,

00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:28.022
–[Dr. Gordon] Freddy…
–[Amanda] The bastard son of a hundred maniacs. 

00:00:28.076 --> 00:00:31.590
While we don't know who the true biological father is, it was probably this guy,

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.126
just based on their similar appearance.  According to Alice Johnson's research on Freddy,

00:00:35.148 --> 00:00:36.674
Amanda gave birth at that very same asylum.

00:00:36.722 --> 00:00:40.086
I imagine she delivered the baby here as opposed to a normal hospital out of shame,

00:00:40.108 --> 00:00:42.114
since nuns are supposed to be celibate.

00:00:42.162 --> 00:00:45.174
She was panicked throughout the entire childbirth and the baby was breached,

00:00:45.222 --> 00:00:47.782
meaning that he was going to come out feet first instead of headfirst.

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:50.534
There's probably some symbolism surrounding the fact that Freddy was born

00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:54.014
upside down, with the mother being a nun and an upside down cross being

00:00:54.052 --> 00:00:55.162
associated with the devil.

00:00:55.226 --> 00:00:58.346
Because through his disastrous life experiences and eventual demonic intervention,

00:00:58.378 --> 00:01:01.726
Freddy would indeed become the antithesis to God.

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:05.406
To learn about Freddy's childhood, how he became the demon of dreams,

00:01:05.428 --> 00:01:07.906
The timeline I pieced together using bits of information throughout the franchise,

00:01:07.928 --> 00:01:11.698
how he represents various scientific sleep phenomena and what the

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:15.894
future now holds for Freddy Krueger, stick around to the end of this video.

