-[Nancy] Six years ago, he killed my friends.

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:45.694
Which means the original, A Nightmare on Elm Street took place in 1981.

00:11:45.732 --> 00:11:48.558
And according to Nancy's diary, which is found in the second movie, the

00:11:48.564 --> 00:11:50.462
weird dreams begin around March 15.

00:11:50.596 --> 00:11:52.190
-[Jesse] March 15.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:59.410
-[Jesse] He comes to me at night, horrible, ugly, dirty, under the sheets with me

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:02.766
-[Jesse] tearing at my nightgown with his steel claws.

00:12:02.878 --> 00:12:07.300
-[Jesse] His name is Fred and he keeps trying to take me to the boiler room.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.514
-[Jesse] He wants to kill me.

00:12:10.632 --> 00:12:13.270
But why does he want to kill her? It's really pretty simple.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:16.114
The more children's souls he collects, the more powerful he becomes.

00:12:16.162 --> 00:12:18.806
And he also needs to make himself known as an urban legend in order to

00:12:18.828 --> 00:12:19.954
strike fear into the town.

00:12:20.002 --> 00:12:22.794
Because if people forget about him, he'll be in danger of losing the power

00:12:22.832 --> 00:12:24.054
to invade dreams.

00:12:24.182 --> 00:12:29.094
-[Freddy] The children still feared me and their fear gave me the power to invade

00:12:29.142 --> 00:12:30.170
-[Freddy] their dreams.

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:34.578
So in March 1981, he chooses four new targets in his old neighborhood on Elm Street.

00:12:34.614 --> 00:12:37.914
Nancy Thompson, Tina Grey, Rod Lane and Glen Lantz.

00:12:37.962 --> 00:12:40.602
And each of them have dreams where Freddy begins his scare tactics.

00:12:40.666 --> 00:12:43.486
Tina's dream includes the appearance of a lamb in a damp hallway which

00:12:43.508 --> 00:12:46.894
represents the sacrificial lamb found in many religions a clue about her

00:12:46.932 --> 00:12:48.850
becoming the first sacrifice of the friend group.

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:51.774
