I think you could also look at the torn clothing as a more subtle way of

00:13:07.708 --> 00:13:10.886
Craven including the detail about Freddy also being a different type of

00:13:10.908 --> 00:13:13.142
predator when it comes to the minors that he's hunting.

00:13:13.206 --> 00:13:15.722
Nancy and Rod both experience similar dreams that night.

00:13:15.776 --> 00:13:17.814
So the next day, both couples stay at Tina's.

00:13:17.862 --> 00:13:21.286
Nancy, at first glance, seems to be protected by the crucifix in the bedroom

00:13:21.318 --> 00:13:24.078
that she's staying in because Freddy seems to retract after starting to

00:13:24.084 --> 00:13:25.050
cross the threshold.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:28.958
Tina, on the other hand, would not be so lucky and finds herself in another

00:13:29.044 --> 00:13:30.590
nightmare scenario.

