00:20:19.704 --> 00:20:20.562
chair over his back.

00:20:20.616 --> 00:20:23.646
But when the flames are extinguished by Nancy's dad, they see Marge's

00:20:23.678 --> 00:20:27.026
charred remains sink back into the dreamscape, with Freddy nowhere to be found.

00:20:27.048 --> 00:20:30.566
My interpretation is that since Freddy found Marge asleep, he was

00:20:30.588 --> 00:20:33.798
able to use her to escape back into the world of dreams, taking her life in

00:20:33.804 --> 00:20:34.422
the process.

00:20:34.556 --> 00:20:36.470
But this battle is not over yet.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.946
As Nancy takes a moment to herself in her room, Freddy takes the opportunity

00:20:40.048 --> 00:20:44.134
to stretch the fabric of reality and apparently the fabric of this bedsheet

00:20:44.182 --> 00:20:44.778
