00:20:44.864 --> 00:20:47.900
But this time, Nancy seems to have him figured out.

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:50.192
–[Freddy]You think you was gonna get away from me?

00:20:51.307 --> 00:20:52.882
–[Nancy] I know you too well now Freddy.

